graph TD
    A[Start Emergent Step] --> B[Format Recent Transcript]
    B --> C[For each Participant: API call assess_engagement]
    C --> D[Parse Intent, Wants_to_Speak, Urgency, Hook]
    D --> E[Apply Contextual Bonuses]
    E --> F[Filter: wants_to_speak == true & intent != stay_silent]
    F --> G{Any >= URGENCY_THRESHOLD?}
    
    G -- Yes --> H[Sort by -urgency and turn_count]
    H --> I[Select top participant]
    I --> J{Consecutive Turns < MAX?}
    J -- Yes --> K[API: call_participant]
    J -- No --> L[Force Moderator Intervention]
    
    G -- No --> M{Consecutive Silence >= 2?}
    M -- Yes --> N[Lower Threshold Fallback]
    N --> I
    M -- No --> L
    
    K --> O[Participant Utterance]
    L --> P[Silence or Forced Trigger]
    O --> Q[API: call_moderator]
    P --> Q
    Q --> R[Update State & Return]
